@startuml "Health checks"

title Health checks système

participant "Load Balancer\n(HAProxy)" as LB
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Next.js API)" as API
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Cache Layer\n(Redis)" as Cache
participant "Message Queue\n(Bull/Redis)" as Queue

LB -> Frontend: GET /health
Frontend -> API: GET /api/health
API -> DB: SELECT 1
DB --> API: Connection OK
API -> Cache: PING
Cache --> API: Redis OK
API -> Queue: Health check
Queue --> API: Queue OK
API --> Frontend: {status: 'healthy'}
Frontend --> LB: Health OK
LB -> LB: Mark instance as healthy

@enduml